<title>NEW ZEALAND: Radio Otago half year profit slips.</title>
<headline>Radio Otago half year profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sep 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.19 vs 0.52</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    4.0 vs 5.0</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.9701 imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 20</p>
<p>Note - Radio Otago Ltd is a radio station.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
